    "chunk_text": "ylte, ond hig comon gesunde to hy\u00f0e. NO11B1 On \u00feone ylcan d\u00e6g by\u00f0 twegra haligra wera tyd \u00fea w\u00e6ron nemnede sanctus Minas ond NO11B3 \u00dea w\u00e6ron \u00e6rest caseres cempan, ond hig gelyfdon eft on Cryst ond for hym martyrdom NO11B5 Ond se heretoga w\u00e6s nemned Pyrrus, he het hig beheafdian for Cristes geleafan. NO15A1 On \u00feone XV d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es by\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s bysceopes tyd se w\u00e6s nemned sanctus Mynus, ond NO15A3 \u00dees bysceop w\u00e6s acenned on \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre \u00fee ys nemned Drasythio, ond on \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre \u00fee NO15A6 He eode drygum fotum ofer w\u00e6ter, ond he ge\u00ferowode martyrdom for Cryste on \u00fe\u00e6re NO15A9 \u00de\u00e6r twegen arlease gebro\u00f0ro hyne nyddon \u00fe\u00e6t he weor\u00f0ode sunnan deofulgyld. NO15A10 \u00dea he \u00fe\u00e6t nolde, \u00fea stycodon hig hyne myd hyra sperum, o\u00f0er foran, o\u00f0er hyndan. NO15A12 \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he to \u00feam bro\u00f0rum, To morgen to \u00feysse tyde yncer \u00e6g\u00f0er ofslyh\u00f0 o\u00f0erne on NO15A17 \u00dea gelamp \u00fe\u00e6t hig huntedon on mergen on \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan stowe. NO15A18 \u00dea gearn sum hynd betweox \u00feam gebro\u00f0rum, ond hig sceoton hyra str\u00e6las to \u00fe\u00e6re hynde NO15A20 Ond \u00fea becom \u00fe\u00e6s yldran str\u00e6l on \u00fe\u00e6s gingran ynno\u00f0, ond \u00fe\u00e6s gyngran str\u00e6l on \u00fe\u00e6s NO15A24 Ond sanctus Mylas ys bebyrged",
